"index_reference": "57001003",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p><em>You</em> is plural, referring to everyone mentioned in <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Phlm1:2\">1:2</a>.</p></li><li><p><em>Grace and peace</em>: This is a traditional Greek and Hebrew greeting. They are now understood as gifts from God  (compare <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Rom5:1-Rom5:2\">Romans 5:1–2</a>).</p></li></ul>",
