"index_reference": "57001010",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p>In the Roman world, owners could be harsh towards slaves who ran away. They could whip, mark, or even execute them.</p></li><li><p>Onesimus was Paul&apos;s spiritual child because he became a Christian through Paul&apos;s ministry.</p></li></ul>",
