"index_reference": "57001015",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<ul><li><p><span><em>He was separated from you</em></span> (literally <em>he went away</em>): This may be a polite way of saying that Onesimus ran away. Paul might be avoiding a direct mention of what Onesimus did.</p></li><li><p><span><em>so that you might have him back for good</em></span>: Paul implies that God guided these events so that Onesimus would come to faith.</p></li></ul>",
