"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Philemon 1:21",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "57001021",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Paul may be suggesting that he hopes Philemon will set Onesimus free (see <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Phlm1:13-Phlm1:14\">1:13–14</a>). He may also be expressing his trust in Philemon’s kindness.</p>",
