"title": "Philemon 1:22",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "57001022",
"language": "eng",
"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Paul asked for a guest room because he planned to visit. This request supported his plea for Philemon to treat Onesimus kindly. When Paul arrived, he would see how Philemon would treat Onesimus.</p>",
