"review_level": "Professional",
"content": "<p>Paul often ends his letters with greetings from others and a blessing. Compare <a href=\"https://ref.ly/Col4:7-Col4:18\">Colossians 4:7–18</a>. Paul’s letters to the Colossians and to Philemon were probably carried to Colossae at the same time by Tychicus and Onesimus.</p>",
